 r←GetTagOfLatestRelease(project path args);username;wsPathRef;repoName;lop;ind
⍝ Desc: Returns the tag of the latest release
⍝ Parse: 1s -verbose -username=
⍝ Project: 1
 r←''
 wsPathRef←⎕NULL
 :If 0<≢lop←⎕SE.Cider.ListOpenProjects 0                ⍝ List Of Projects
 :AndIf (≢lop)≥ind←lop[;2]⍳⊂path
     wsPathRef←⍎⊃lop[ind;]                              ⍝ [1] is the namespace, [2] the path
 :EndIf
 :If ⎕NULL≡wsPathRef
     repoName←⊃⌽'/'(≠⊆⊢){'/'@(⍸'\'=⍵)⊣⍵}path            ⍝ Not a Cider project: take the folder name
 :Else
     repoName←wsPathRef.CiderConfig.CIDER.projectSpace
 :EndIf
 :If 0≡args.username
     'Cannot establish the GitHub username; specify it with -username='Assert ⎕NULL≢wsPathRef
     username←{(¯1+≢⍵)⊃⍵}'/'(≠⊆⊢)wsPathRef.CiderConfig.CIDER.project_url
 :Else
     username←args.username
 :EndIf
 r←args.verbose ##.GetTagOfLatestRelease username repoName
⍝Done
